<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.tag.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>Tag 是 gpui-component 标签组件的 RML 封装。无 ElementId 构造（StatelessNoId），容器模式，文本通过子节点设置。</p>
            <p>支持 primary/secondary/danger/success/warning/info 等变体属性和 size 尺寸。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>默认样式的标签。</p>
            <div h-flex="" gap-2="" flex-wrap="">
                <Tag>Default</Tag>
                <Tag primary="">Primary</Tag>
                <Tag secondary="">Secondary</Tag>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="状态变体">
            <p>使用 danger/success/warning/info 属性显示不同状态颜色。</p>
            <div h-flex="" gap-2="" flex-wrap="">
                <Tag danger="">Danger</Tag>
                <Tag success="">Success</Tag>
                <Tag warning="">Warning</Tag>
                <Tag info="">Info</Tag>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="尺寸">
            <p>size 属性控制标签大小。</p>
            <div h-flex="" gap-2="" flex-wrap="">
                <Tag size="small" primary="">Small</Tag>
                <Tag size="medium" primary="">Medium</Tag>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="动态绑定(model + if 条件渲染)">
            <p>输入标签文本,点击按钮循环切换变体,观察标签实时变化(演示 model 双向绑定 + if 条件渲染):</p>
            <input model={tag_text} placeholder="输入标签文本" />
            <p>当前文本: {tag_text} | 当前变体: {variant_label}</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <Button label="切换变体" primary="" on-click={on_cycle_variant} />
            </div>
            <div h-flex="" gap-2="" flex-wrap="">
                <Tag if={variant_index == 0}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                <Tag primary="" if={variant_index == 1}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                <Tag secondary="" if={variant_index == 2}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                <Tag danger="" if={variant_index == 3}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                <Tag success="" if={variant_index == 4}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                <Tag warning="" if={variant_index == 5}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                <Tag info="" if={variant_index == 6}>{tag_text}</Tag>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
